## 02:00 - Database, Centralized Cache & Observability Hardening
- Changes:
  - `methods/ad_control.py`: Cached admin ad overrides in L1 (300s TTL).
  - `methods/scoring_engine.py`: Cached user quota and upload metrics in L1 (90s TTL), eliminating 4-6 Supabase queries per page navigation.
  - `methods/guide_service.py`: Cached user guide progress in L1 (180s TTL) with explicit column projections.
  - `methods/supabase_helper.py`: Optimized 1,000-document catalogue projections; fast-path user_id in `get_user_file_history`.
