  - `scheduled_tasks.py`: Checked `WERKZEUG_RUN_MAIN` to stop duplicate APScheduler initialization under Werkzeug reloader.
  - `static/js/notification-bell.js`: Paused polling when tab is hidden (`document.hidden`).
  - `observability/metrics.py`: Added Prometheus structured metrics for CACHE_*, SUPABASE_*, and BG_JOBS.
  - Replaced deprecated `datetime.utcnow()` with `datetime.now(timezone.utc)`.
  - Verification: 36 unit tests passed in `test_cache_manager.py` and `test_observability.py`.

